  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_002 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.635). This experiment tests whether changing the fusion method from weighted to concat (while keeping all other parameters identical) impacts performance. This isolates the effect of fusion strategy, a critical design choice, and helps determine if the current high-performing configuration's success depends on weighted fusion. It balances exploitation of the strong baseline (config_002) with exploration of a key hyperparameter."
